  "layoutPrinciples": [
    "Original Atlas V2 cyan borders define five fixed lower columns: left [OH07,OH08,OH09], electric [OH10,11,12], center [circuit / emergency / ground-wiper], fourth [OH15,16,17, voice REC atlas OH18, press-diff atlas OH19], right [OH20,21,22].",
    "The previous duplicate/misleading source filenames do not define atlas IDs: OH18-GROUND-CALL image belongs to the lower center OH14 area, while OH19-VOICE image represents real atlas OH18.",
    "One OH07-08 immutable source image is separated visually into two crops at image row 1216; same PNG remains unchanged.",
    "Artwork scales to intended plate region without clipping letters; fill intentionally permits anisotropic fit where original aspect ratio was reconstructed incorrectly. The user can compare against unchanged Atlas View.",
    "Footer OH23-25 shares a single original image; only documented white canvas margins are excluded in view.",
    "All five columns finish y=3276, bottom strip begins y=3281.",
    "No original locked image files renamed, overwritten, or deleted."
